# Journey stage 1 from the title's Play to the results card, driving the real
# UI: Play, then the plate by keyboard (an arrow key brings the focus ring to
# the first cell, arrows move it, Enter launches the arrow under it), in the
# order the rules engine's solver gives for the seeded stage (seed 201, so
# the plate is the same every run). Then Next stage, the pause card and Quit
# to Title.
until 300 Arrow Exodus
frames 150
save title
# (Play's face is letter-spaced capitals, which the script cannot click by text: Tab focuses it)
key Tab 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
until 120 Journey 1 — First Flight
frames 30
save journey
key ArrowUp 2
frames 2
key ArrowRight 2
frames 2
key ArrowRight 2
frames 2
key ArrowRight 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
frames 6
key ArrowLeft 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
frames 6
key ArrowLeft 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
frames 6
key ArrowDown 2
frames 2
key ArrowRight 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
frames 6
key ArrowUp 2
frames 2
key ArrowLeft 2
frames 2
key ArrowLeft 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
frames 6
until 120 Plate cleared!
expect Flawless bonus
frames 150
save results
click Next stage
until 120 Journey 2 — Cross Traffic
key KeyP 2
until 30 Resume
save pause
click Quit to Title
until 60 Daily Challenge
